From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 21:50:48 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] InputStreamAddon: do not close an input that never opened

The destructor closes the input, and Close uses the add-on interface that
only Open allocates. An input destroyed before it opened, or closed twice,
dereferences a null interface.
---
 xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDInputStreams/InputStreamAddon.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDInputStreams/InputStreamAddon.cpp b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDInputStreams/InputStreamAddon.cpp
--- a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDInputStreams/InputStreamAddon.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDInputStreams/InputStreamAddon.cpp
@@ -0,6 +0,9 @@
 
 void CInputStreamAddon::Close()
 {
+  if (!m_ifc.inputstream)
+    return;
+
   if (m_ifc.inputstream->toAddon->close)
     m_ifc.inputstream->toAddon->close(m_ifc.inputstream);
   DestroyInstance();
